	<h2>Our Founding Vision: Eliminating the Freelancer Guesswork</h2>
	<p>
		The global independent workforce is experiencing a massive transformation. Millions of talented professionals are opting out of traditional corporate hierarchies in pursuit of geographic autonomy, creative control, and flexible working hours. However, independent contracting has historically suffered from a critical blind spot: <em>arbitrary pricing and operational isolation</em>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Most freelancers struggle with underpricing their services, neglecting unbillable administrative capacity, and accepting client scope creep that degrades their effective hourly earnings. Simultaneously, the rapid emergence of generative artificial intelligence has left many independent contractors unsure of how to adapt their skills.
	</p>
	<p>
